    "answer": {
      "short": "Purchase price: $\\$3200$. Sales minus purchase price: $-\\$200$, representing a loss of $\\$200$.",
      "worked": "Total purchase price:\n$$200\\times\\$16=\\$3200.$$\nSales minus purchase price:\n$$\\$3000-\\$3200=-\\$200.$$\nThe negative result represents a loss of $\\$200$.",
